Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:05.14,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,‎HANYA MELEWATI BAGIAN TENGAHNYA...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:08.97,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}‎HAHA
